  "description_nl": "From the schemas' own descriptions: TDS sections are written without the leading 1 (194A = 94A, 194-I(b) rent = 4-IB, 194J professional = 94J-B); ReturnFileSec 11 = 139(1), 12 = 139(4), 17 = 139(5) revised, 21 = 139(8A) updated; ITR-3 status I / H and verifies as S (self) / K (karta); ITR-5 status 1 firm (sub 10 partnership, 5 LLP), 14 AOP/BOI.",
